{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "24", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "06", "M": "33", "S": "05"}}, "news": [{"title": "Kajaria Ceramics targets \u20b96,000 crore revenue, \u20b91,000-1,100 crore EBITDA in FY27: MD", "para": "Kajaria Ceramics expects revenue to grow to about \u20b96,000 crore in FY27 and \u20b97,000 crore in FY28, supported by tile capacity expansion, price increases, cost optimisation and growth in sanitaryware, faucets and adhesives. The company reported \u20b94,832.50 crore revenue, \u20b9861.95 crore EBITDA and \u20b9485.41 crore net profit in FY26.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/allied-industries/kajaria-ceramics-targets-6000-crore-revenue-1000-1100-crore-ebitda-in-fy27-md/133451536?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-68174/133451536.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "allied-industries"}, {"title": "Raidurg real estate rush drives record earnings for Telangana exchequer", "para": "Hyderabad Knowledge City has emerged as a vital financial asset for Telangana, recently generating over ten thousand crore rupees from land auctions. A standout sale featured an acre of Raidurg land fetching an astounding two hundred sixty-four crore rupees. The burgeoning IT sector has dramatically amplified the value of this prime real estate, while transparent bidding practices are ensuring competitive pricing and maximizing the state's revenue potential.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/raidurg-real-estate-rush-drives-record-earnings-for-telangana-exchequer/133451139?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-412700/133451139.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Pay 10.8% interest to buyers for flat handover delay: Haryana RERA to Pyramid Infratech", "para": "Haryana RERA has mandated Py